\page platformrte_docs_INTEGRATION Integrating RteFramework into Your Project

This guide shows how to use RteFramework as a dependency in your own C/embedded project, and how to reuse its CMake configurations and tools.

\section platformrte_docs_INTEGRATION_table_of_contents Table of Contents

1. \ref platformrte_docs_INTEGRATION_installation "Installation"
